1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,800
Finding a place to call home should be exciting. But for many people in Nairobi, house hunting means endless calls, outdated listings, wasted trips, unclear information… and sometimes, listings you simply can't trust.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:21,800
You can spend hours searching, money moving around, and still not know whether the property is actually available — or who you're dealing with.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:31,800
That’s why we built NyumbaSearch. A smarter way to discover properties, connect with the right people, and make the journey from searching to moving in much easier.

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:44,800
Instead of jumping from post to post, search in one place. Explore properties by location, price, and what actually matters to you. See property details, compare options, view locations on the map, and connect directly with the people responsible for the property.

5
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:54,800
And because trust matters, NyumbaSearch works to validate properties before they become part of the platform. We don't just open the door to anyone claiming to have a property.

6
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:07,800
For property owners and managers, NyumbaSearch isn't just about listing a vacant unit. It helps you manage your properties, organize units and tenants, track rent and payment records, and connect with potential tenants.

7
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:19,800
From leases and units to rent collection, invoices, and tenant activity, property management becomes more organized and easier to follow.

8
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:30,800
Moving into a home also comes with everything around the home. That’s where NyumbaSearch connects tenants and property owners with trusted service providers — from moving and maintenance to other essential home services.

9
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:41,800
And because moving isn't only about finding a house, NyumbaSearch is building connections to financial services that can help customers make better-informed decisions around housing costs.

10
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:51,800
Whether you're looking for a home, managing one, living in one, or providing the services that keep homes running… NyumbaSearch brings the journey closer together.

11
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:01,800
Less uncertainty. Less running around. Less wasted time. More information. More connections. And a simpler way to move toward a place you can call home.

12
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:09,500
NyumbaSearch. Find. Connect. Move in.

13
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:19,500
Start your search today. Visit nyumbasearch.com. Your next home could be one search away.
